is a cocartesian square in $ \mathtt{DGCA}_k $.

\la{simpadj}
\la{simpad}   
$(i)$ The adjunction in Lemma~\ref{prep1} extends simplicially to a Quillen adjunction $(\mbox{--})_n^{\ob}: \mathtt{s}\mathtt{Alg}^{\ob}_k\, \leftrightarrows \, \mathtt{s}\mathtt{CAlg}_k\,:\mathcal{M}_n(\mbox{--})$.\\

$(ii)$ Consequently, there is an adjunction between homotopy categories 
